// Hocking County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Pages that block automated fetching (the Auditor's property
// search, the Board of Elections, the City of Logan, the library, the chamber,
// United Way, the humane society and the Common Pleas case search) were checked
// in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * Logan-Hocking Local Schools moved to loganhocking.school (the old k12
//     address only redirects; the county site still links it).
//   * The City of Logan's current site is cityoflogan.oh.gov; the county still
//     links cityofloganohio.com.
//   * United Way of Hocking County is now unitedwayhocking.org.
//   * OhioMeansJobs now points to the South Central Ohio JFS center page instead
//     of the statewide site, and moved to Business & Economy.
//   * The Auditor's property search is still Pivot Point (auditor.hocking.oh.gov);
//     an older DDTI "classic" search address no longer exists.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Logan WV/UT/IA and Logan County OH; thelogantheatre.com is Chicago; Nelsonville
//   and Athens are Athens County; Lake Hope State Park is Vinton County; Clear Creek
//   Metro Park is Fairfield County; integratedservice.org is now a for-sale domain
//   (ISBH's own isbh.org is used).
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * One city (Logan, the seat). Laurelville is the only village with a site;
//     Murray City has none; Buchtel is filed under Athens County.
//   * One school district based in the county (Logan-Hocking). Tri-County Career
//     Center and Hocking College's main campus are in Nelsonville; Hocking College
//     also has a Logan campus.
//   * Job and Family Services is the multi-county South Central Ohio JFS; mental
//     health is the 317 Board (Athens-Hocking-Vinton); community action is HAPCAP.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * Southeastern Ohio Regional Jail (Nelsonville), as for other regional jails.
//   * laurelvillevfd.com (domain gone) and the other volunteer fire departments.
//   * The county fair, historical society, Logan Theater and WLGN radio: Facebook
//     only or no site found.
//   * Laurelville Elementary belongs to Logan Elm schools (Pickaway County).
//   * The Recorder's records search, sheriff sales and Municipal Court payments:
//     vendor portals.

